// Whole fixed-argument evaluation of structural postcomposition. Keep both
// runtime presentations; this compares the complete original prewhiskering
// functor, including all higher parameter action.
unif_rule
  @comp_fapp0 Cat_cat _ _ _ (@fapp0_func _ _ $D)
    (nerve_lax_postcomposition_func $K $A $B)
  ≡ @hom_precomp_along_func Cat_cat Cat_cat (@id Cat_cat Cat_cat) $B0 $K0 $A0 $D0
  ↪ [ $K0 ≡ $K; $A0 ≡ $A; $B0 ≡ $B; $D0 ≡ $D ];
